  "description": "Workfow Server is a ready-to-use Workflow Engine-based application that you can deploy into your infrastructure. It can be integrated with NodeJS, PHP, Ruby, .NET, or Java applications via a REST API. Workflow Server is a key component for managing the lifecycle of business objects within your enterprise.\n      Key features:\n      - Rest API - Manage schemes and processes with GET and POST requests to Workflow Server.\n      - Web UI - Enjoy a responsive web-based interface, enabling you to make change on the fly.\n      - Business Flow - Get form names depending on user role or type for each workflow instance.\n      - Reports - Visualize process states, and key information on schemes, processes and performance.",
